+                .allMatch(value -> value.equals(1L))
+        );
+    }
+
+    private static void assertTimeSeriesAggregation(final InternalTimeSeries timeSeriesAggregation) {
+        final List<Map<String, Object>> dimensions = timeSeriesAggregation.getBuckets()
+            .stream()
